    <entry>
      <title>如何自建网站</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/12/2026-10-12-feishu-post-32dc5ad9/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/12/2026-10-12-feishu-post-32dc5ad9/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>当你拥有一个前端项目时，希望公之于众，并且从其中获得收益上面是我的一些经验参考</p><p>前置需要：正常运行的前端项目、服务器、域名</p><h2 id="一、备案"><a href="#一、备案" class="headerlink" title="一、备案"></a>一、备案</h2><ol><li>首先走阿里云ICP备案，个人备案的话需要提供当地的**居住证，**审核周期在一周左右</li><li>在ICP备案之后，还需要在公安系统备案</li></ol><p><a href="https://ywtb.mps.gov.cn/authservice/login?service=https://ywtb.mps.gov.cn/authservice/oauth2.0/callbackAuthorize?client_name=CasOAuthClient&client_id=6cd3ecce-33bf-4d29-b3da-b2ce40707fbb&redirect_uri=https://beian.mps.gov.cn/cyber_sso/gov/loginByGov">地址:北京市东长安街14号 邮编:100741 京ICP备05070602号-6 京公网安备 11010102000001号 政府网站标识码:bm09000013</a></p><h2 id="二、申请CA证书-Nginx代理"><a href="#二、申请CA证书-Nginx代理" class="headerlink" title="二、申请CA证书 + Nginx代理"></a>二、申请CA证书 + Nginx代理</h2><h4 id="1️⃣CA-证书申请（Let’s-Encrypt-webroot）"><a href="#1️⃣CA-证书申请（Let’s-Encrypt-webroot）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣CA 证书申请（Let’s Encrypt + --webroot）"></a>1️⃣CA 证书申请（Let’s Encrypt + <code>--webroot</code>）</h4><p>原理：certbot 把验证文件丢进指定目录，CA 从公网 <code>http://域名/.well-known/acme-challenge/xxx</code> 读走</p><h4 id="2️⃣Nginx部署流程"><a href="#2️⃣Nginx部署流程" class="headerlink" title="2️⃣Nginx部署流程"></a>2️⃣Nginx部署流程</h4><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># =====================================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#  拼豆.xyz  (punycode: xn--muu023g.xyz)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#  前端: nginx 直接托管 /var/www/pingdou 下的 Vite 构建产物</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#  后端: /api/ 反代到本机 3000 的 Express 进程（systemd: pingdou-backend）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#  证书: Let&#x27;s Encrypt，webroot 校验，certbot 自动续期</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># =====================================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 80：只保留 ACME 校验，其余全部跳 443 ----------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">server</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">listen</span>      <span class="number">80</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">listen</span>      [::]:<span class="number">80</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">server_name</span> xn--muu023g.xyz www.xn--muu023g.xyz;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 必须放在跳转之前，且用 ^~ 阻止任何回退，</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 否则 3 个月后自动续期时校验请求会被 301 掉导致续期失败</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># Let&#x27;s Encrypt 续期证书时来验证&quot;你真的是这个域名的拥有者&quot;用的</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span><span class="regexp"> ^~</span> /.well-known/acme-challenge/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">root</span>         /var/www/certbot-webroot;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">default_type</span> <span class="string">&quot;text/plain&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">allow</span>        all;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> / &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">return</span> <span class="number">301</span> https://<span class="variable">$host</span><span class="variable">$request_uri</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 443 ----------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">server</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">listen</span>      <span class="number">443</span> ssl;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">listen</span>      [::]:<span class="number">443</span> ssl;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">http2</span>       <span class="literal">on</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">server_name</span> xn--muu023g.xyz www.xn--muu023g.xyz;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_certificate</span>     /etc/letsencrypt/live/xn--muu023g.xyz/fullchain.pem;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_certificate_key</span> /etc/letsencrypt/live/xn--muu023g.xyz/privkey.pem;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_protocols</span>             TLSv1.<span class="number">2</span> TLSv1.<span class="number">3</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_prefer_server_ciphers</span> <span class="literal">off</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_session_cache</span>         shared:SSL:<span class="number">10m</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_session_timeout</span>       <span class="number">1d</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">ssl_session_tickets</span>       <span class="literal">off</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 不开 OCSP stapling：Let&#x27;s Encrypt 已于 2025 年停止在证书中带 OCSP 地址</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">add_header</span> Strict-Transport-Security <span class="string">&quot;max-age=31536000&quot;</span> always;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">add_header</span> X-Content-Type-Options    <span class="string">&quot;nosniff&quot;</span> always;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">add_header</span> Referrer-Policy           <span class="string">&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot;</span> always;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">root</span>  /var/www/pingdou;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">index</span> index.html;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">client_max_body_size</span> <span class="number">2m</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># ---- 后端 API ----</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> /api/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_pass</span>         http://127.0.0.1:3000;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_http_version</span> <span class="number">1</span>.<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span>   Host              <span class="variable">$host</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span>   X-Real-IP         <span class="variable">$remote_addr</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span>   X-Forwarded-For   <span class="variable">$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span>   X-Forwarded-Proto <span class="variable">$scheme</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 鉴权走 cookie（前端 fetch 带 credentials:&#x27;include&#x27;）。</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 注意：实测 nginx 默认就双向透传 Cookie / Set-Cookie，下面两行并非必需，</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 保留是为了显式声明鉴权关键头，防止后续有人加 proxy_hide_header /</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># proxy_cache 把语义改掉。对照实验见 docs/tutorial-nginx-https.md「坑 5」。</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span>   Cookie            <span class="variable">$http_cookie</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_pass_header</span>  Set-Cookie;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># ---- 构建产物带内容 hash，可长缓存 ----</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> /assets/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">expires</span> <span class="number">1y</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">add_header</span> Cache-Control <span class="string">&quot;public, immutable&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">access_log</span> <span class="literal">off</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># ---- 商品图片：从运行时目录服务 ----</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> /products/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">alias</span> /var/lib/pingdou/images/;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># ---- SPA 回退 ----</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> / &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">try_files</span> <span class="variable">$uri</span> <span class="variable">$uri</span>/ /index.html;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>为什么后端不直接暴露给用户？</strong></p><ul><li>后端进程只监听 <code>127.0.0.1:3000</code>，外网根本访问不到，只有 Nginx 能连它。</li><li>这样后端不用自己处理 HTTPS、证书、静态文件、限流……全部甩给 Nginx。</li><li>安全性、性能、可维护性都更好</li></ul><p><strong><code>/assets/</code> —— 前端构建产物长缓存</strong></p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section">location</span> /assets/ &#123;    <span class="attribute">expires</span> <span class="number">1y</span>;    <span class="attribute">add_header</span> Cache-Control <span class="string">&quot;public, immutable&quot;</span>;    <span class="attribute">access_log</span> <span class="literal">off</span>;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>Vite 构建出来的 JS&#x2F;CSS 文件名里带内容 hash（比如 <code>index-a3f9c1.js</code>），内容一变文件名就变，所以可以放心缓存一年。</li><li><code>immutable</code> 是告诉浏览器”这个 URL 的文件内容永远不会变，别再发请求问我了”。</li><li><code>access_log off</code>：这些请求量大且无意义，不记日志，省磁盘。</li></ul><p>这就是前端性能优化的经典套路：文件名带 hash + 长缓存 &#x3D; 二次访问秒开。</p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">浏览器请求 /assets/index-a3f9c1.<span class="attribute">js</span></span><br><span class="line">      ↓</span><br><span class="line">Nginx 从 /var/www/pingdou/assets/index-a3f9c1.js 读文件</span><br><span class="line">      ↓</span><br><span class="line">连同文件内容 + 响应头(Cache-Control: public, immutable; Expires: 一年后) 一起返回</span><br><span class="line">      ↓</span><br><span class="line">浏览器：把文件存进本地缓存，并记住&quot;这个 <span class="attribute">URL</span> 一年内不用再问服务器<span class="string">&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Nginx 关键作用</strong></p><ol><li><strong>统一入口</strong>：只开 80&#x2F;443，后端 3000 仅本机访问。</li><li><strong>强制 HTTPS</strong>：80 全部 301 跳 443，并做 TLS 加解密。</li><li><strong>证书续期</strong>：放行 ACME 校验，对接 certbot 自动续期。</li><li><strong>安全头</strong>：HSTS、nosniff、Referrer-Policy。</li><li><strong>静态托管</strong>：直接发前端产物，<code>/assets/</code> 长缓存。</li><li><strong>图片服务</strong>：<code>/products/</code> 映射运行时图片目录。</li><li><strong>反向代理</strong>：<code>/api/</code> 转 127.0.0.1:3000，透传真实 IP 与 Cookie。</li><li><strong>SPA 回退</strong>：<code>try_files</code> 防刷新 404。</li></ol><h2 id="三、百度收录网站"><a href="#三、百度收录网站" class="headerlink" title="三、百度收录网站"></a>三、百度收录网站</h2><ol><li><p>百度站点管理新增网站：<a href="https://ziyuan.baidu.com/site/index#">https://ziyuan.baidu.com/site/index#</a></p></li><li><p>提交给爬虫，便于加速百度收录：<a href="https://ziyuan.baidu.com/linksubmit/index?site=https://www.xn--muu023g.xyz/">https://ziyuan.baidu.com/linksubmit/index?site=https://www.xn--muu023g.xyz/</a></p><ol><li>api提交：批量，且主动</li><li>siteMap：被动发现</li><li>手动提交：网站页面少可以使用，主动提交</li></ol></li></ol><p><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/dream_weave/article/details/102644701">小技巧 - 如何在百度搜索到自己的网站（新站必看）？_打开百度搜索网站-CSDN博客</a></p>]]></content>
      
      
